  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently, pid/resume.txt in the working directory isn't deleted after a successful migration run. So, if you kick off another batch after the first successful one, you can run into a conflict with the information in pid/resume.txt. Deleting resume.txt after a successful run would take care of that issue.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
